OL,3,GNEWSALibrary to reopen after
OL,4,Aseven-month refurbishment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed library which has
OL,7,Fbeen closed for seven months for a
OL,8,Fmajor refurbishment will reopen to the
OL,9,Fpublic next week, it has been
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FIlkley town centre's library and
OL,13,Fvisitor information centre has moved
OL,14,Fback into the Victorian building and
OL,15,Fwill be open on Monday, according to
OL,16,FBradford Council.
OL,18,FDuring the work, the library was
OL,19,Frunning from temporary accommodation at
OL,20,FIlkley Town Hall.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
