OL,3,GNEWSALibrary to reopen after
OL,4,Aseven-month refurbishment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said that visitors would
OL,7,Fsee changes such as new accessible
OL,8,Ftoilets and better lighting and
OL,9,Fheating, while a new kitchen for
OL,10,Fcommunity groups and organisations
OL,11,Fusing the space had also been added.
